'''KF Drenasi''' ({{Langx|sq|Klubi i Futsallit Drenasi}}, formerly ''Klubi Futbollistik Drenasi''), is a professional [[futsal]] and former [[Association football|football]] club based in [[Drenas]], [[Kosovo]]. The club play in the [[Futsal Superleague of Kosovo]], which is the top tier of futsal in the country."}}
